{"id":"n61839-1-7","stage":4,"title":"산소 · 坟墓","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61839-1-7-1","ko":"돌아가신 어머니는 항상 고향 땅을 그리워 하셨지.","zh":"过世的妈妈一直很思念故乡。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"돌아가신","meaning":"去世，逝世","explanation":"돌아가다：去世，逝世；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"돌아가다","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74103","senseId":"7","lemma":"돌아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌아가신","audio":"/audio/bfc4d873fbdb148d3d22.mp3"}},{"text":"어머니는","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니는","audio":"/audio/e9534e0c288558be0260.mp3"}},{"text":"항상","meaning":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","explanation":"항상：总，总是，老，老是，经常","readings":[{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83162","senseId":"1","lemma":"항상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}},{"text":"고향","meaning":"故乡，家乡","explanation":"고향：故乡，家乡","readings":[{"term":"고향","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27364","senseId":"1","lemma":"고향","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고향","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3"}},{"text":"땅을","meaning":"地区，土地","explanation":"땅：地区，土地；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"땅","audio":"/audio/f330041e9e005a6bf8b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30206","senseId":"3","lemma":"땅","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"땅을","audio":"/audio/0b105703b0ee529638f6.mp3"}},{"text":"그리워","meaning":"思念，怀念","explanation":"그립다：思念，怀念；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"그립다","audio":"/audio/b0dcbd20216264fb84be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37070","senseId":"1","lemma":"그립다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그리워","audio":"/audio/f9031fd70f96b1ec6b3b.mp3"}},{"text":"하셨지.","meaning":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","explanation":"하다：表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62899","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하셨지","audio":"/audio/329f2bdfae5e5c1539b6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1152d7a56fb1600a","term":"돌아가다","zh":"去世，逝世","audio":"/audio/1152d7a56fb1600a5774.mp3","entryId":"74103","definition":"(尊称)死去。","pronunciation":["도라가다"]},{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"f1d42a32366087dd","term":"항상","zh":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3","entryId":"83162","definition":"无论什么时候都没变地。","pronunciation":["항상"]},{"id":"998538467e18fc3a","term":"고향","zh":"故乡，家乡","audio":"/audio/998538467e18fc3a541b.mp3","entryId":"27364","definition":"出生成长的地方。","pronunciation":["고향"]},{"id":"f330041e9e005a6b","term":"땅","zh":"地区，土地","audio":"/audio/f330041e9e005a6bf8b4.mp3","entryId":"30206","definition":"地域或地方。","pronunciation":["땅"]},{"id":"b0dcbd20216264fb","term":"그립다","zh":"思念，怀念","audio":"/audio/b0dcbd20216264fb84be.mp3","entryId":"37070","definition":"非常想念，想见面。","pronunciation":["그립따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62899","definition":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5b68c8861e0679d0262a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61839-1-7-2","ko":"그 곳에 산소를 만들어 드려서 다행이다.","zh":"幸好把她安葬在故乡了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"